{"id":779,"slug":"a-nos-amours","title":"À nos amours","year":1983,"country":"France","duration":102,"spine":337,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/779-a-nos-amours","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/35cf4d7e4b34e9705e7113e2ca9dfed5/y44618NZ3bA8g2AcdsVMOZc5lfTtIZ_large.jpg","description":"With his raw style of filmmaking, Maurice Pialat has been called the John Cassavetes of French cinema, and the scorching À nos amours is one of his greatest achievements. In a revelatory film debut, the dynamic, fresh-faced Sandrine Bonnaire plays Suzanne, a fifteen-year-old Parisian who embarks on a sexual rampage in an effort to separate herself from her overbearing, beloved father (played with astonishing magnetism by Pialat himself), ineffectual mother, and brutish brother. A tender character study that can erupt in startling violence, À nos amours is one of the high-water marks of eighties French cinema. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Maurice Pialat","slug":"maurice-pialat"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Sandrine Bonnaire","role":"Suzanne","slug":"sandrine-bonnaire"},{"actor":"Evelyne Ker","role":"The mother","slug":"evelyne-ker"},{"actor":"Maurice Pialat","role":"The father","slug":"maurice-pialat"},{"actor":"Dominique Besnehard","role":"Robert","slug":"dominique-besnehard"},{"actor":"Cyr Boitard","role":"Luc","slug":"cyr-boitard"},{"actor":"Cyril Collard","role":"Jean-Pierre","slug":"cyril-collard"},{"actor":"Maïté Maillé","role":"Martine","slug":"maite-maille"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Maurice Pialat","slug":"maurice-pialat"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Arlette Langmann","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Maurice Pialat","slug":"maurice-pialat"},{"role":"Associate producer","person":"Emmanuel Schlumberger","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Micheline Pialat","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Yann Dedet","slug":null},{"role":"Sound","person":"Jean Umansky","slug":null},{"role":"Music","pe